@startuml breadknife-tray-menu
participant 用户
participant "窗口进程" as win
participant "bread daemon（breadpan）" as daemon
participant "托盘 Item" as item

用户 -> win: 右键托盘图标
win -> daemon: tray.interact(right)（IPC）
daemon -> item: AboutToShow → GetLayout → GetGroupProperties
item --> daemon: 最新全量布局
note right of daemon: 同步等待发生在此进程；窗口主循环不受影响
daemon --> win: Outcome::Menu（菜单快照）
win -> win: GTK 渲染弹出
用户 -> win: 点击条目
win -> daemon: tray.menu_activate（IPC）
daemon -> item: Event
daemon --> win: 受理结论
@enduml
